(12, 'about_text_en', 'MEASH CLEANING SOLUTION is Addis Ababa’s premier residential and commercial deep cleaning specialist. Equipped with modern steam and extraction machines, hospital-grade eco-friendly chemicals, and vetted background-checked cleaning professionals.', 'general', '2026-10-27 20:52:20', '2026-10-27 20:52:20'),
(13, 'about_text_am', 'ሜሽ ክሊኒንግ ሶሉሽን (MEASH CLEANING SOLUTION) በአዲስ አበባ ከተማ ለመኖሪያ ቤቶች፣ ለቢሮዎች፣ ለሆቴሎች እና ለተቋማት አስተማማኝ እና ጥራት ያለው የጥልቅ ጽዳት አገልግሎት በዘመናዊ ማሽኖችና ኬሚካሎች በመታገዝ በታማኝነት ይሰጣል።', 'general', '2026-10-27 20:52:20', '2026-10-27 21:32:40');
